# Keys trusted to sign uun's monthly EoL data bundles (ssh-keygen -Y verify).
# Format: one line per key, see ALLOWED SIGNERS in ssh-keygen(1):
#
#   eol@uun namespaces="uun-eol",valid-after="20261201" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... uun-eol-signing
#
# Rotation: add the new key with valid-after, keep the old one with a
# valid-before date, ship both in a uun release, then remove the old line.
# Until a key is added here, uun refuses every bundle.
